{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的纵向交替排法不如X左右分栏容易扫读，尤其S08—S11这些停留时间较短的段落，信息切换显得密集。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段关键动机和心理转折突出出来，又通过反复出现的「自己人」「受过的气」「不愿回头」串起整条心理变化，让人更容易理解他为什么矛盾、为什么最后选择带着想念继续生活。分时出现的音乐细节也更具体，能听出情绪如何从愤怒、怀念、焦虑逐渐转向柔软和重新站稳，而不只是获得几个笼统的情绪标签。X的优势是左右分栏更利于快速扫读，叙事句也更连贯，但在音乐细节的颗粒度和关键心理节点的辨识度上，Y更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e15d8cc5-2eeb-4055-84a4-e3ae256a9e24", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T214218483983Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:43:30.887484+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8fdca42d6e37007661f23a412a48d29dbde86adf69add27ccde0c774d319ba81", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c